          {
            "title": "Last item",
            "id": 96223,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Python memungkinkan kita menggunakan <strong>pengindeksan negatif</strong> untuk mengambil nilai dari akhir objek yang dapat diindeks, seperti list.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"4.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"latest = scores[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(latest)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>latest</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Explained",
            "id": 97110,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pengindeksan negatif berarti kita mengambil elemen dari sisi paling kanan sebuah list. Kita menggunakan simbol <code>-</code> untuk menunjukkan indeks negatif.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"last = users[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Tom\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>last</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pengindeksan negatif mengambil elemen dari sisi paling kanan list.</p><p>Kita menggunakan simbol <code>-</code> untuk menunjukkan indeks negatif.</p><p>Simpan pengguna <strong>terakhir</strong> dalam <code>last</code> menggunakan indeks negatif, lalu cetak <code>last</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"last = users[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"users\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Tom\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>1</code>, diikuti oleh <code>last</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Item position",
            "id": 96224,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menggunakan nilai negatif apa pun hingga dan termasuk panjang list, yang akan mengambil nilai pertama.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ratings = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ratings[\" /><text value=\"-6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>-</code>, diikuti oleh <code>6</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menggunakan nilai negatif apa pun hingga sepanjang list, yang akan mengambil nilai pertama.</p><p>List memiliki <code>6</code> rating. Gunakan indeks negatif yang mencapai nilai <strong>pertama</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ratings = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ratings[\" /><text value=\"-6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>-</code>, diikuti oleh <code>6</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Modifying list items",
            "id": 96225,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita juga dapat mengubah item list pada posisi yang diberikan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jack&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ahmed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Jill', 'Ahmed', 'Elaine']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>-</code>, diikuti oleh <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dengan indeks negatif, ganti pengguna <strong>pertama</strong> dengan <code>\"Jill\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jack&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ahmed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Jill', 'Ahmed', 'Elaine']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>-</code>, diikuti oleh <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Tuples",
            "id": 96226,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuple juga merupakan struktur data berurutan dan nilainya dapat diambil, tetapi tuple bersifat <strong>immutable</strong> sehingga tidak dapat diubah.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"info = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Graz&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Austria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Europe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;World&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"info[\" /><text value=\"-4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vienna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"TypeError: 'tuple' object does not support item assignment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Out of range error",
            "id": 96227,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita akan menemui error jika mencoba mengambil nilai pada posisi di luar jangkauan objek.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"results = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Win&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Loss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Draw&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"results[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>-</code>, diikuti oleh <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>List hanya memiliki <code>3</code> item. Gunakan indeks negatif yang melewati awalnya agar memunculkan <code>IndexError: list index out of range</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"results = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Win&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Loss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Draw&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"results[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>-</code>, diikuti oleh <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "`del` keyword",
            "id": 96228,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Keyword <code>del</code> memungkinkan kita menghapus objek atau item di dalam struktur data.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"winners = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sigmund&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Olaf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" winners[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(winners)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['John', 'Helen', 'Sigmund']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>del</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "`del` objects",
            "id": 96230,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del</code> dapat digunakan untuk menghapus objek apa pun, termasuk struktur data seperti dictionary, list, dan set.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"letters = {\" /><text value=\"'a'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'b'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'c'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" letters\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(letters)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NameError: name 'letters' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>letters</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Keyword <code>del</code> menghapus variabel, termasuk variabel yang menyimpan list, dictionary, atau set.</p><p>Setelah menghapusnya, coba cetak variabel untuk memunculkan <code>NameError</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"letters = {\" /><text value=\"'a'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'b'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'c'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" letters\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(letters)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;letters&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NameError: name 'letters' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, <code>letters</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "`del` on dictionary",
            "id": 96231,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa menggunakan <code>del</code> dengan sebuah key di dalam dictionary untuk menghapus pasangan <code>key:value</code> yang tidak diinginkan dari dictionary.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"product = {\" /><text value=\"'category'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"'book'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'price'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"4.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" product[\" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(product)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"del\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'category': 'book', 'price': 4.99}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>product</code>, diikuti oleh <code>[</code>, dan terakhir <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menggunakan <code>del</code> dengan key di dalam dictionary untuk menghapus pasangan key:value yang tidak diinginkan.</p><p>Gunakan <code>del</code> untuk menghapus pasangan key:value <code>\"in_shop\"</code> dari <code>product</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"product = {\" /><text value=\"'category'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"'book'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'price'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"4.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" product[\" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(product)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'price'\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"del\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'category': 'book', 'price': 4.99}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>product</code>, diikuti oleh <code>[</code>, <code>'in_shop'</code>, dan terakhir <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: indexing",
            "id": 96238,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nilai indeks apa yang bisa kita gunakan saat mengambil item dari list?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nilai positif atau negatif dalam rentang list</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python hanya mengizinkan nilai positif untuk digunakan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nilai positif atau negatif dalam rentang list.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Item list dapat diambil dengan nilai indeks positif atau negatif yang berada dalam rentang list.</p><p>Sebuah list memiliki empat item. Rencana pengindeksan mana yang mengambil item tanpa error?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Gunakan <code>2</code> dari awal atau <code>-2</code> dari akhir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Gunakan hanya nilai positif karena Python menolak indeks negatif</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Gunakan <code>4</code> karena merujuk ke item keempat</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Gunakan nilai negatif apa pun karena indeks negatif tidak dapat berada di luar rentang</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gunakan <code>2</code> dari awal atau <code>-2</code> dari akhir.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: indexing",
            "id": 96239,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ambil nilai pertama dan terakhir dari tuple untuk digunakan dalam pesan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paris&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = user[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"age = user[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{age}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(message)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Joe 27\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>user</code>, diikuti oleh <code>0</code>, lalu <code>user</code>, <code>-</code>, <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ambil nilai <strong>pertama</strong> dan nilai <strong>terakhir</strong> dari tuple untuk pesan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paris&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = user[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"age = user[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{age}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(message)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Joe 27\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>user</code>, diikuti oleh <code>0</code>, <code>user</code>, <code>-</code>, dan terakhir <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: list items",
            "id": 96233,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nilai apa yang akan dicetak oleh kode ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"members = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hayley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gareth&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(members[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Sarah\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sarah</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hayley</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Sarah.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Indeks negatif menghitung mundur dari akhir list, dimulai dengan <code>-1</code> untuk item terakhir.</p><p>Telusuri <code>-3</code> dalam kode. Anggota mana yang dicetak?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"members = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hayley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gareth&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(members[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Sarah\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sarah</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hayley</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Anna</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Gareth</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Sarah.</p></body></html>"
