            "title": "Example: `del` list item",
            "id": 96236,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan <code>del</code> untuk menghapus item terakhir dalam list.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"orders = [\" /><text value=\"'A'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'B'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'C'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" orders[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(orders)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['A', 'B']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>del</code>, diikuti oleh <code>-</code>, dan terakhir <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hapus item <strong>terakhir</strong> dalam list.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"orders = [\" /><text value=\"'A'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'B'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'C'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" orders[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(orders)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['A', 'B']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>del</code>, diikuti oleh <code>-</code>, dan terakhir <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
